{"version":1,"id":"conan-gray-maniac","title":"Maniac","artist":"Conan Gray","key":"Eb","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/conan-gray/maniac/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Daniel Leonard Nigro and Conan Gray","chords":[{"symbol":"Ab","canonical":"Ab","keyboardPitchClasses":[8,0,3],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Cm","canonical":"Cm","keyboardPitchClasses":[0,3,7],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Bb","canonical":"Bb","keyboardPitchClasses":[10,2,5],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Eb","canonical":"Eb","keyboardPitchClasses":[3,7,10],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Fm","canonical":"Fm","keyboardPitchClasses":[5,8,0],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"section","text":"[Primeira Parte]","columns":16,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"You were with your friends, partying","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ab","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"When the alcohol kicked in","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":24,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Said you wanted me dead","columns":23,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"So, you showed up at my home, all alone","columns":39,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ab","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"With a shovel and a rose","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":20,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"Do you think I'm a joke?","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"section","text":"[Pré-Refrão]","columns":12,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"'Cause people like you always want back what they can't have","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ab","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":57,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"But I'm past that and you know that","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"So you should turn back to your rat pack tellin' 'em trash","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":3,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"Tell all of your friends that I'm crazy and drive you mad","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ab","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"That I'm such a stalker, a watcher, a psychopath","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Eb","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Then tell them you hate me and dated me just for laughs","columns":55,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ab","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"So, why do you call me and tell me you want me back?","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Eb","column":15,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"You maniac","columns":10,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"(Maniac, some may say that I'm a) You maniac","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ab","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"(Maniac, some may say that I'm a) You maniac","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Eb","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":19,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"(Maniac, some may say that I'm a) You maniac","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ab","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"(Maniac, some may say that I'm a)","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Eb","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":19,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"section","text":"[Segunda Parte]","columns":15,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"You just went too far","columns":21,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ab","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"Wrecked your car, called me crying in the dark","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":42,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"Now you're breakin' my heart","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"So, I show up at your place right away","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ab","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"Wipe the tears off of your face","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":28,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"While you beg me to stay","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"section","text":"[Pré-Refrão]","columns":12,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"Well, people like you always want back what they can't have","columns":59,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ab","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":57,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"But I'm past that and you know that","columns":35,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"So you should turn back to your rat pack tellin' 'em trash","columns":58,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Cm","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"Tell all of your friends that I'm crazy and drive you mad","columns":57,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ab","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"That I'm such a stalker, a watcher, a psychopath","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Eb","column":16,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":39,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"Then tell them you hate me and dated me just for laughs","columns":55,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ab","column":18,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":"So, why do you call me and tell me you want me back?","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Eb","column":15,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-38","kind":"lyric","text":"You maniac","columns":10,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-39","kind":"lyric","text":"(Maniac, some may say that I'm a) You maniac","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ab","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-40","kind":"lyric","text":"(Maniac, some may say that I'm a) You maniac","columns":44,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Eb","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":19,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-41","kind":"lyric","text":"(Maniac, some may say that I'm a) You maniac","columns":44,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ab","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-42","kind":"lyric","text":"(Maniac, some may say that I'm a)","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Eb","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":19,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-43","kind":"section","text":"[Ponte]","columns":7,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-44","kind":"lyric","text":"Psychopathic, don't be so dramatic","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Ab","column":14,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-45","kind":"lyric","text":"We had magic, but you made it tragic","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Eb","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":15,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-46","kind":"lyric","text":"Now you're manic, honestly, I've had it","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Ab","column":18,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-47","kind":"lyric","text":"Listen to yourself, think you need to get some help","columns":51,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Eb","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bb","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-48","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-49","kind":"lyric","text":"Tell all of your friends that I'm crazy and drive you mad","columns":57,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Ab","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-5